 "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/", "name": "Models live in the data: qualify, certify, license", "description": "With AI, methods are within everyone's reach; what gives a result its value is data that are qualified, certified and clearly licensed. Basic rules, the example of Webservice-Energy and a tree to choose a license.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/donnees/#page"}, "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#fair", "name": "FAIR principles", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#metadata", "name": "Metadata", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/"}], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#findable", "name": "Findable", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#interoperable", "name": "Interoperable", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistent-identifier", "name": "Persistent identifier", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.