r its metadata.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-thredds-opendap", "name": "THREDDS, OPeNDAP", "description": "A scientific data server and the protocol that reads only the useful part (an area, a period) without downloading everything.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-netcdf-cf", "name": "NetCDF-CF", "description": "A file format for scientific grids and series, with conventions (CF) that fix variable names, units and coordinates.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-stac", "name": "STAC", "description": "SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog: a standard way to catalogue satellite imagery and cloud-native data.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-geo-copernicus-cams-c3s", "name": "GEO, Copernicus, CAMS, C3S", "description": "The Group on Earth Observations (an intergovernmental partnership), the European Earth observation programme and two of its services: atmosphere (CAMS) and climate change (C3S).", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-cc-by", "name": "CC BY", "description": "Creative Commons Attribution: anyone may copy, adapt and reuse, commercially too, provided the author is credited. Meant for texts, figures and data.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-cc-by-nc", "name": "CC BY-NC", "description": "The same, for non-commercial uses only.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-mit", "name": "MIT", "description": "A very permissive software licence: free use, modification, redistribution and sale, provided the copyright notice and the licence text are kept; no warranty.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-apache-2-0", "name": "Apache 2.0", "description": "Permissive like MIT, plus an explicit patent licence from contributors and a duty to flag modified files.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-bsd", "name": "BSD", "description": "A family of permissive licences close to MIT; the three-clause version also forbids using the authors' names to promote a derived product.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-gpl", "name": "GPL", "description": "A copyleft licence: any derived software that is distributed must be under the GPL, with its source code.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-polyform-noncommercial", "name": "PolyForm Noncommercial", "description": "A software licence that allows any non-commercial use: personal use, research, experiment, teaching, and use by non-commercial organizations (educational institutions, public research, charities, government bodies). Commercial use needs another agreement with the author. The licence must travel with redistributed code.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary-open-source-osi", "name": "Open source (OSI)", "description": "The Open Source Initiative definition: an open-source licence may not restrict any field of use; a non-commercial licence is therefore not \"open source\", even if the code is open to read.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/#glossary"}}]}, {"@type": "DataCatalog", "name": "Webservice-Energy", "url": "https://www.webservice-energy.org", "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "creator": [{"@type": "Person", "name": "Lionel Ménard", "affiliation": "Centre O.I.E., Mines Paris – PSL", "sameAs": ["https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2156-8538", "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/annuaire-de-la-recherche/chercheur/lionel-menard/"]}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Raphaël Jolivet", "sameAs": ["https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7149-5010", "https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OqhXwQ8AAAAJ"], "affiliation": "Centre O.I.E., Mines Paris – PSL"}], "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Centre O.I.E., Mines Paris – PSL", "url": "https://www.oie.minesparis.psl.eu/"}, "description": "Spatial data infrastructure for energy, environment and Earth observation (catalogue, THREDDS, OGC services, WPS, STAC, libinsitu)."}, {"@type": "ProfilePage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/a-propos/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/a-propos/", "name": "À propos de Cyril Voyant", "description": "Parcours, recherche, projets, distinctions, publications, code et contact de Cyril Voyant, directeur de recherche à Mines Paris – PSL.", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "mainEntity": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/", "givenName": "Cyril", "familyName": "Voyant", "jobTitle": ["Research Director", "Directeur de Recherche (DR2)", "Visiting Professor"], "image": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/assets/cyril-voyant-200.jpg", "worksFor": {"@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/#organization", "name": "Mines Paris – PSL University", "url": "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/"}, "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/#organization", "name": "Mines Paris – PSL University", "url": "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/"}, {"@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://www.oie.minesparis.psl.eu/#organization", "name": "Centre Observation, Impacts, Énergie (O.I.E.)", "url": "https://www.oie.minesparis.psl.eu/"}, {"@type": "Organization", "@id": "https://fin.kg.ac.rs/#organization", "name": "Faculty of Engineering, University of Kragujevac", "url": "https://fin.kg.ac.rs/en/"}], "hasOccupation": [{"@type": "Occupation", "name": "Editorial Board Member, Scientific Reports"}, {"@type": "Occupation", "name": "Editorial Board Member, Sustainability"}], "memberOf": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "European Technology and Innovation Platform for Photovoltaics (ETIP PV)", "url": "https://etip-pv.eu/"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Scientific Reports (Nature Portfolio), Editorial Board", "url": "https://www.nature.com/srep/about/editors"}, {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Sustainability (MDPI), Editorial Board, Energy Sustainability section", "url": "https://www.mdpi.com/journal/sustainability/sectioneditors/energy_sustainability"}], "mainEntityOfPage": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/", "sameAs": ["https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0242-7377", "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q58251573", "https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=aUlP6agAAAAJ", "https://cv.hal.science/cyril-voyant", "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyril-voyant-2a7767192/", "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/", "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/", "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/"], "knowsAbout": ["Hybrid modeling", "Solar forecasting", "Forecast evaluation", "Frugal artificial intelligence", "Radiobiology", "Medical physics", "Language models as interfaces to scientific codes"]}, "translationOfWork": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/about/#page"}, "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#forecastability-f", "name": "Prévisibilité F", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/variabilite-previsibilite/"}], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistance", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#scv", "name": "sCV", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/variabilite-previsibilite/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Accueil", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "À propos", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/a-propos/"}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/actualites/forecasting-with-less/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/actualites/forecasting-with-less/", "name": "BLEND : une meilleure persistance sans entraîner de réseau neuronal", "description": "Introduire la phase quotidienne (le moment de la journée) dans une prévision de persistance (qui recopie la dernière mesure) améliore les résultats sur les séries solaires étudiées, avec des écarts qui s’accentuent aux horizons plus longs (le délai entre la dernière mesure et l’instant prévu).", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "about": [{"@id": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/approach.html#principle-2"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistance", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#blend", "name": "BLEND", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}], "keywords": ["Hybrider", "Énergie"], "translationOfWork": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/forecasting-with-less/#page"}, "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#nrmse", "name": "nRMSE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#convex-combination", "name": "Combinaison convexe", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#cyclic-persistence", "name": "Persistance cyclique", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#cliper", "name": "CLIPER", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#rmse", "name": "RMSE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.co