arch, 2(5), 172."}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory. General Solar Position Calculations.", "url": "https://gml.noaa.gov/grad/solcalc/solareqns.PDF"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Duffie, J. A., Beckman, W. A. (2013). Solar Engineering of Thermal Processes, 4th ed. Wiley.", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1002/9781118671603"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Kopp, G., Lean, J. L. (2011). A new, lower value of total solar irradiance: Evidence and climate significance. Geophysical Research Letters, 38(1).", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1029/2010GL045777"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Reda, I., Andreas, A. (2004). Solar position algorithm for solar radiation applications. Solar Energy, 76(5), 577-589.", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.solener.2003.12.003"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Anderson, K. S. et al. (2023). pvlib python: 2023 project update. Journal of Open Source Software, 8(92), 5994.", "url": "https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.05994"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "IANA. Time Zone Database.", "url": "https://www.iana.org/time-zones"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data, 1:110m land.", "url": "https://www.naturalearthdata.com/"}]}, {"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/animations/test-khi-deux/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/animations/test-khi-deux/", "name": "Test du χ² : dé équilibré, observés, attendus et tableau 2×2", "description": "Pour 120 lancers d’un dé équilibré, 20 résultats attendus par face. Modifiez une face et voyez sa contribution au χ² ; tableau 2×2 du cours.", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url