uez significativité et variation décrite.", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "translationOfWork": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/correlation-significance-r-squared/#page"}, "keywords": "corrélation de Pearson, coefficient de détermination R², régression linéaire, test de Student sur la pente, ordonnée à l’origine, centrage, valeur aberrante, biostatistique"}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Accueil", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Outils interactifs", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Corrélation, significativité et R² : à ne pas confondre", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/correlation-significativite-r2/"}]}, {"@type": "LearningResource", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/animations/correlation-significativite-r2/#learning", "name": "Corrélation, significativité et R² : animation pour les distinguer", "inLanguage": "fr", "learningResourceType": "Interactive demonstration", "educationalUse": ["demonstration", "self study"], "teaches": "Un lien statistiquement significatif explique-t-il beaucoup de variation ?", "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "isBasedOn": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/enseignement/biostatistique/correlation-regression/#chapter"}, "educationalLevel": "Enseignement supérieur", "license": "https://creativeco