imulator/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "At a glance", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/overview/"}]}, {"@type": "ItemList", "name": "Software, with its DOI and its team", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "NICEᵏ: normalized forecast errors compared with simple persistence (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23562549", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/nice-metrics", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "sCV and F: variability and forecastability of solar irradiance (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23562553", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/solar-variability-scv", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "The γ-index: tolerance-based validation of spatio-temporal forecast fields (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21755936", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/temporal-gamma-index", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "ARTU: second-order autoregressive reference method for solar radiation forecasting", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21755931", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/ARTU", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 5, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "BLEND and CLIPER: persistence operators for cyclostationary energy processes (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18812333", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/cyclostationary-forecasting-matlab", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 6, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "Per-cell, spatial and compressed forecasters of satellite solar irradiance: benchmark code (MATLAB, Python)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23562557", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/cell-vs-field-irradiance", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 7, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "MIMO-ELM forecasting of the Corsican electricity mix (MATLAB, Python, EDF open data)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23562559", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/Data_Viz_2024", "license": "GPL-3.0"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 8, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "PV_ELM_pred: benchmark of persistence, BLEND, autoregression and ELM variants for PV forecasting (Python)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21487267", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/PV_ELM_pred", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 9, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "Make_Stationary: deseasonalization benchmark for renewable-energy time series (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21490743", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/Make_Stationary", "license": "GPL-3.0"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 10, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "Filter and wrapper diagnostics of dimensionality reduction for endogenous PV power forecasting (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21755938", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/pv-dimensionality-reduction", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 11, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "RAIR-Sim: compartmental simulator of radioactive iodine therapy response in metastatic thyroid cancer (MATLAB)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21496197", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/CTD_SIMU_RAI", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 12, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "Influence Index: a log-based measure of research influence for institutions (MATLAB, processed data)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19706465", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/influence-index-bibliometrics", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 13, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "LQL-Equiv 2014: biologically equivalent dose calculation in radiotherapy (MATLAB application)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16739882", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/LQ-Equiv", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 14, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "Tunnel Load Simulator: synthetic electricity demand of road tunnels (Python, Streamlit)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20080042", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/tunnel-load-simulator", "license": "MIT"}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 15, "item": {"@type": "SoftwareSourceCode", "name": "LQL-Equiv-web 3.0: biologically equivalent doses in radiotherapy (Python, browser)", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21948623", "codeRepository": "https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/LQL-Equiv-web", "license": "MIT"}}]}, {"@type": "DefinedTermSet", "name": "Words used on this page", "inLanguage": "en", "hasDefinedTerm": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "DOI", "description": "Permanent identifier of a paper or archived software: the link stays valid even if the website changes."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Persistance / persistence", "description": "The forecast copies the last known value; it is the reference to beat."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "BLEND, CLIPER", "description": "Two mixes of simple references: persistence with the value one cycle earlier (BLEND), or with the mean (CLIPER)."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "ELM", "description": "Extreme learning machine: a one-hidden-layer neural network with random input weights; only the output weights are computed."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "MIMO", "description": "Multiple inputs, multiple outputs: one model forecasts several signals."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "NICE", "description": "A forecast's error divided by that of persistence; between 0 and 1, the forecast adds something."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "sCV, F", "description": "Cloud-driven variability and the forecastability of a signal, computed before any model."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Indice γ / γ-index", "description": "A test that accepts small shifts in space, time and intensity."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "LQ, LQL", "description": "Linear-quadratic and linear-quadratic-linear models of the effect of a radiation dose on tissue."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "BNCT", "description": "Boron neutron capture therapy."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "PV, EDF", "description": "Photovoltaic; Électricité de France, the French utility."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "MATLAB", "description": "A numerical computing language and environment."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "CC BY 4.0", "description": "Creative Commons Attribution license: free reuse, provided the authors are credited."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "AI Act", "description": "The European Union regulation on artificial intelligence."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "RTVACOS", "description": "Seven criteria: rigor, transparency, visibility, adoption, collaboration, outreach, societal relevance."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "ROC", "description": "ROC (receiver operating characteristic) curve: a test's sensitivity against its false-positive rate."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "PASS, UE, B.U.T.", "description": "The French first-year health program; teaching unit; French bachelor of technology."}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-pv-reduction-dimension/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-pv-reduction-dimension/", "name": "Prévision PV : réduire la dimension", "description": "Prévoir la puissance électrique directement à partir de son historique évite de reconstruire toute la chaîne rayonnement–panneaux–onduleur. Mais une journée de mesures n’est pas nécessairement une journée d’informations indépendantes : réduire la dimension, c’est la résumer par moins de valeurs…", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "about": [{"@id": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/approach.html#principle-3"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#elm", "name": "Extreme Learning Machine (ELM)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/actualites/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}], "keywords": ["Apprendre frugalement", "Énergie"]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Accueil", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Récits", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Prévision PV : réduire la dimension", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-pv-reduction-dimension/"}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-faire-simple/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-faire-simple/", "name": "Prévision solaire : faire simple", "description": "Prévoir le solaire, c’est distinguer ce que l’on sait déjà — le mouvement du Soleil — de ce qu’il reste à anticiper : les nuages, la dynamique locale et l’état réel du système.", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "about": [{"@id": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/approach.html#principle-2"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#blend", "name": "BLEND", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistance", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#cliper", "name": "CLIPER", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}], "keywords": ["Calculer directement", "Énergie"], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#convex-combination", "name": "Combinaison convexe", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#nice", "name": "NICE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/nice/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#artu", "name": "ARTU", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/artu/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#climatological-mean", "name": "Moyenne", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#cyclic-persistence", "name": "Persistance cyclique", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/blend/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#elm", "name": "Extreme Learning Machine (ELM)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/actualites/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#nrmse", "name": "nRMSE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#ratio-to-trend", "name": "Rapport à la tendance", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#scv", "name": "sCV", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/outils/variabilite-previsibilite/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#simulated-data", "name": "Données simulées", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/tunnel-load-simulator/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Accueil", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Récits", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Prévision solaire : faire simple", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-faire-simple/"}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-modeles-frugaux/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-modeles-frugaux/", "name": "Prévision solaire : modèles frugaux", "description": "Un modèle de prévision ne se juge pas uniquement sur son erreur. Il doit aussi tenir dans le dispositif, répondre à temps et rester maintenable. La frugalité consiste à rechercher la capacité utile, en démontrant ce que chaque supplément de complexité apporte.", "inLanguage": "fr", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "about": [{"@id": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/approach.html#principle-3"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#elm", "name": "Extreme Learning Machine (ELM)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/actualites/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}], "keywords": ["Apprendre frugalement", "Énergie"], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistance", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/variabilite-memoire-previsibilite/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Accueil", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Récits", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recits/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Prévision solaire : modèles frugaux", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/prevision-solaire-modeles-frugaux/"}]}, {"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-excellence-rtvacos/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-excellence-rtvacos/", "name": "RTVACOS: the research-excellence tree, a toolbox for researchers", "description": "An interactive mirror of the RTVACOS framework: four foundations (rigor, transparency, visibility, adoption) as roots, three amplifiers as branches. Tick your practices, the tree grows; no score.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/excellence-rtvacos/#page"}, "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#forecast-evaluation", "name": "Forecast evaluation", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/evaluate-solar-forecast-persistence/"}], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#nice", "name": "NICE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/nice-forecast-evaluation/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistence", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/variability-memory-forecastability/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Excellence (RTVACOS)", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-excellence-rtvacos/"}]}, {"@type": "ScholarlyArticle", "name": "Beyond Publish and Pray: Engineering Research Excellence", "url": "https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6877118", "datePublished": "2026", "identifier": "doi:10.2139/ssrn.6877118", "description": "Research excellence modeled as a multiplicative system, E ∝ (R × T × V × A) × (1 + C + O + S): four foundations (Rigor, Transparency, Visibility, Adoption potential) whose product collapses if any one approaches zero, and three amplifiers (Collaboration, Outreach, Societal relevance) that scale a solid foundation. A tool for reflection, not for ranking.", "teaches": "E ∝ (R × T × V × A) × (1 + C + O + S)", "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "RTVACOS framework equation", "termCode": "E ∝ (R × T × V × A) × (1 + C + O + S)", "description": "Equation 1 of the preprint. E: research excellence operationalized as impact capacity; R Rigor, T Transparency, V Visibility, A Adoption potential (foundations); C Collaboration, O Outreach, S Societal relevance (amplifiers). Proportionality, not equality: a heuristic for reflection, not a score; no empirical validation yet."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Rigor (R)", "description": "Foundation"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Transparency (T)", "description": "Foundation"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Visibility (V)", "description": "Foundation"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Adoption potential (A)", "description": "Foundation"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Collaboration (C)", "description": "Amplifier"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Outreach (O)", "description": "Amplifier"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Societal relevance (S)", "description": "Amplifier"}], "author": [{"@type": "Person", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Rodrigo Amaro e Silva", "sameAs": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2813-150X"}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Nicolas Fichaux", "sameAs": "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2824-0387"}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Lionel Ménard", "sameAs": "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2156-8538"}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Sylvain Cros", "sameAs": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7702-2123"}, {"@type": "Person", "name": "Rodanthi-Elisavet Mamouri", "sameAs": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4836-8560"}]}, {"@type": "CollectionPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/", "name": "Research and projects", "description": "Research of Cyril Voyant: solar variability, parsimonious forecasting, evaluation, current and earlier programs.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/projets-de-recherche/#page"}, "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#blend", "name": "BLEND", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/forecasting-with-less/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#forecastability-f", "name": "Forecastability F", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-forecast-solar-power/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#gamma-index", "name": "γ-index", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/gamma-index-forecast-validation/"}], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#nice", "name": "NICE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/nice-forecast-evaluation/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistence", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/variability-memory-forecastability/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#elm", "name": "Extreme learning machine (ELM)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#scv", "name": "sCV", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-forecast-solar-power/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#mimo", "name": "MIMO (multiple-input multiple-output)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/about/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Research and projects", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/"}]}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-fine4cast", "name": "Fine4Cast", "description": "Forecasting renewable production and demand from minutes to days ahead at fine resolution.", "startDate": "2023", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "ANR / PEPR TASE (France 2030)"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "alternateName": "Next Generation Energy Demand and Renewable Production Forecasting Tools for Fine Geographical and Temporal Scales", "endDate": "2028", "sameAs": "https://www.pepr-tase.fr/en/projet/fine4cast_en/"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-electre", "name": "ELECTRE", "description": "Flagship project of the Carnot M.I.N.E.S institute on the electrification of uses.", "startDate": "2023", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Institut Carnot M.I.N.E.S"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "alternateName": "Électrification des usages", "endDate": "2026", "sameAs": "https://www.carnot-mines.eu/project/electrification-des-usages/"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-corse-cnrs", "name": "Mines Paris – PSL / Université de Corse / CNRS", "description": "Solar forecasting and energy management for smart microgrids.", "startDate": "2024", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "CNRS"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "endDate": "2027"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-saphir", "name": "SAPHIR", "description": "Sensor-augmented high-resolution weather forecasting.", "startDate": "2022-01", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "ANR"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "alternateName": "Prévisions météorologiques à haute résolution améliorées par des données capteurs", "sameAs": "https://anr.fr/Projet-ANR-21-CE04-0014"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-hyles", "name": "HyLES", "description": "Hydrogen in island grids: Corsica, La Réunion, French Polynesia.", "startDate": "2021-01", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "ANR"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "alternateName": "Intégration de l'hydrogène dans les réseaux faiblement ou non interconnectés", "endDate": "2024", "sameAs": "https://anr.fr/Projet-ANR-20-CE05-0035"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-intelpoly", "name": "INTELPOLY", "description": "Diagnosis, control and cybersecurity of polygeneration and hybrid-storage plants.", "startDate": "2021", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "COST"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "endDate": "2025"}, {"@type": "ResearchProject", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#p-tilos", "name": "TILOS", "description": "Battery storage and renewables on the island of Tilos.", "startDate": "2015-02-01", "funder": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "European Union, Horizon 2020"}, "member": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "alternateName": "Technology Innovation for the Local Scale, Optimum Integration of Battery Energy Storage", "endDate": "2019-01-31", "sameAs": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/646529"}, {"@type": "DefinedTermSet", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/research-projects/#acronyms", "name": "Program acronyms", "hasDefinedTerm": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "ANR", "description": "Agence nationale de la recherche: the French public agency that funds research through competitive calls."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "PEPR TASE", "description": "Priority research program (PEPR) on advanced technologies for energy systems (TASE), funded by France 2030 and operated by the ANR; it supports upstream research (readiness levels 1 to 4)."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Carnot M.I.N.E.S", "description": "Carnot institute “Innovative methods for companies and society”: partnership research of the Écoles des Mines, ENSTA Paris and École polytechnique, holding the Carnot label since 2006; the ARMINES association manages the contracts."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "COST", "description": "European Cooperation in Science and Technology: a European program that funds networks of researchers (the “Actions”), not the research itself."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "Horizon 2020", "description": "The European Union framework program for research and innovation, 2014-2020."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "FEMTO-ST", "description": "Franche-Comté Electronics, Mechanics, Thermal Science and Optics – Sciences and Technologies institute (Besançon), coordinator of HyLES."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "LE2P", "description": "Laboratory of energetics, electronics and processes, University of La Réunion."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "UPF", "description": "University of French Polynesia, a HyLES partner through its GEPASUD laboratory (South Pacific geosciences)."}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": "UCPP-SPE", "description": "Università di Corsica Pasquale Paoli, Sciences for the Environment laboratory (SPE), a joint unit with the CNRS."}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/", "name": "Scientific publishing: no verification of data and code, no trust", "description": "Too many articles, unpaid review, record retractions, generative AI: what exists (FAIR, OSTP, EU Council, CoARA, AI Act, French Digital Republic Act) and what is missing, checking data and code.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/edition-scientifique-confiance/#page"}, "about": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#fair", "name": "FAIR principles", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#findable", "name": "Findable", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#interoperable", "name": "Interoperable", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/fair-self-assessment/"}], "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistent-identifier", "name": "Persistent identifier", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/data/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Scientific publishing", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/"}]}, {"@type": "Article", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust#essay", "headline": "Scientific publishing: no verification of data and code, no trust", "datePublished": "2026-10-24", "dateModified": "2026-11-04", "inLanguage": "en", "keywords": ["scholarly publishing", "open science", "reproducibility", "code verification", "FAIR data", "AI Act", "MLOps", "peer review", "generative AI"], "mainEntityOfPage": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust#page"}, "author": {"@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "citation": [{"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Hanson, Gómez Barreiro, Crosetto, Brockington (2024). The strain on scientific publishing. Quantitative Science Studies 5(4)", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1162/qss_a_00327"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Larivière, Haustein, Mongeon (2015). The oligopoly of academic publishers in the digital era. PLoS ONE 10(6)", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0127502"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "RELX (2026). RELX 2025 results", "url": "https://www.relx.com/media/press-releases/year-2026/relx-2025-results"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Aczel, Szaszi, Holcombe (2021). A billion-dollar donation: estimating the cost of researchers' time spent on peer review. Research Integrity and Peer Review 6", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1186/s41073-021-00118-2"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Van Noorden (2023). More than 10,000 research papers were retracted in 2023, a new record. Nature 624", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-023-03974-8"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "NIH (2023). NOT-OD-23-149: generative AI prohibited in NIH peer review", "url": "https://grants.nih.gov/grants/guide/notice-files/NOT-OD-23-149.html"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "OSTP (2022). Ensuring free, immediate, and equitable access to federally funded research", "url": "https://bidenwhitehouse.archives.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/08-2022-OSTP-Public-Access-Memo.pdf"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Wilkinson et al. (2016). The FAIR Guiding Principles for scientific data management and stewardship. Scientific Data 3", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2016.18"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Journal of Open Source Software: open review on GitHub", "url": "https://joss.readthedocs.io/"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Nüst, Eglen (2021). CODECHECK: an open science initiative for the independent execution of computations. F1000Research 10", "url": "https://doi.org/10.12688/f1000research.51738.2"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "ReScience C: reproducible replications in computational science", "url": "https://rescience.github.io/"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Council of the EU (2023). Conclusions on high-quality, transparent, open, trustworthy and equitable scholarly publishing (9616/23)", "url": "https://european-research-area.ec.europa.eu/documents/council-conclusions-high-quality-transparent-open-trustworthy-and-equitable-scholarly"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Science Europe, cOAlition S, OPERAS, ANR (2022). Action Plan for Diamond Open Access", "url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6282402"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "European Commission. Open Research Europe", "url": "https://open-research-europe.ec.europa.eu/"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "CoARA. Agreement on Reforming Research Assessment (2022)", "url": "https://coara.eu/agreement/the-agreement-full-text/"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (AI Act)", "url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Loi n° 2016-1321 pour une République numérique, article 30 (art. L533-4 du code de la recherche)", "url": "https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/jorf/id/JORFTEXT000033202746"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Deuxième Plan national pour la science ouverte 2021-2024", "url": "https://www.enseignementsup-recherche.gouv.fr/fr/une-politique-ambitieuse-pour-la-science-ouverte-50735"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Software Heritage, l'archive universelle du code source", "url": "https://www.softwareheritage.org/"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "SoftwareX: research software publications and reuse", "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/softwarex"}]}, {"@type": "FAQPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust#faq", "inLanguage": "en", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Is scientific publishing really in trouble?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The number of indexed articles grew by about 47% between 2016 and 2022, faster than the number of researchers; unpaid peer review no longer keeps up, and more than 10,000 papers were retracted in 2023, a record."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Should AI be banned from writing and reviewing?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No: it should be declared. As with any other tool, authors state what was used and for what; what matters is that results are checked, data and code included."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Why bring the AI Act into a discussion of articles?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Because it requires of high-risk AI systems what articles lack: data governance, technical documentation, record-keeping, a quality management system and post-market monitoring."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do we need new journals?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not necessarily. What is missing is verification and recognition of editorial work, not more titles."}}]}, {"@type": "DefinedTermSet", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary", "name": "Glossary of scholarly publishing", "inLanguage": "en", "hasDefinedTerm": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-diamond-open-access", "name": "Diamond open access", "description": "Journals free for both authors and readers, funded by institutions.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-apc-article-processing-charge", "name": "APC (Article Processing Charge)", "description": "Fee paid by authors, or their institution, to publish an article in open access.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-codecheck", "name": "CODECHECK", "description": "A third party runs an article's code and certifies that the reported figures and tables are regenerated; it does not judge scientific validity.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-coara", "name": "CoARA", "description": "European coalition to reform research assessment: recognize the diversity of contributions, not only article counts.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-doi", "name": "DOI", "description": "Persistent identifier of an article, a dataset or a software version.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-paper-mill", "name": "Paper mill", "description": "Organization selling fabricated or falsified articles, often slipped into special issues.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-fair", "name": "FAIR", "description": "Findable, accessible, interoperable, reusable: principles for data, not a license.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-mlops", "name": "MLOps", "description": "Engineering practices to version, trace, deploy and monitor learning models.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-reproducibility", "name": "Reproducibility", "description": "Recovering a result with the same data and code; replication recovers it with new data.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary-retraction", "name": "Retraction", "description": "Official withdrawal of a published article for serious error or fraud; the article stays visible, marked as retracted.", "inDefinedTermSet": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/scientific-publishing-trust/#glossary"}}]}, {"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/search/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/search/", "name": "Search the site", "description": "Search research, courses, interactive tools and publications on Cyril Voyant’s website.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/recherche/#page"}}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}]}, {"@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/atmospheric-neutrons-bnct/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/atmospheric-neutrons-bnct/", "name": "Atmospheric neutrons and BNCT: model, dose and limits", "description": "