castability/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#clear-sky-index", "name": "Clear-sky index", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/variability-memory-forecastability/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#mae", "name": "MAE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/evaluate-solar-forecast-persistence/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#blend", "name": "BLEND", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/forecasting-with-less/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#cliper", "name": "CLIPER", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/forecasting-with-less/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#forecastability-f", "name": "Forecastability F", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-forecast-solar-power/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#p-value", "name": "p-value", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/tools/student-t-test/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Teaching", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/teaching/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Course", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/teaching/solar-forecasting-course/"}]}, {"@type": "Course", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/teaching/solar-forecasting-course/#course", "name": "Solar forecasting course: forecasting the intermittent solar resource", "description": "A 59-slide course on forecasting solar irradiance one hour ahead, taught in the UE14 applied research project of the Mines Paris – PSL engineering curriculum, built on ten years of hourly measurements from Ajaccio (Corsica). It goes from the solar signal and the difference to the clear-sky trend (denoted CSI in the course) to autoregressive models fitted by least squares, then to Extreme Learning Machines, online learning and frugality, every model judged against persistence; on the 2007 test year, the daytime nRMSE is 22.0 % for smart persistence, 21.3 % for AR(2) and 20.5 % for an ELM.", "inLanguage": "en", "courseCode": "UE14", "educationalLevel": "Engineering curriculum (Mines Paris – PSL)", "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "provider": {"@type": "CollegeOrUniversity", "name": "Mines Paris – PSL", "url": "https://www.minesparis.psl.eu/"}, "isBasedOn": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/teaching/solar-forecasting-basics.html", "hasPart": [{"@type": "MediaObject", "name": "Solar forecasting course: forecasting the intermittent solar resource (PowerPoint)", "encodingFormat": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation", "contentUrl": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/assets/course/Forecasting-the-Intermittent-Solar-Resource_EN.pptx"}, {"@type": "MediaObject", "name": "Solar forecasting course: forecasting the intermittent solar resource (PDF)", "encodingFormat": "application/pdf", "contentUrl": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/assets/course/Forecasting-the-Intermittent-Solar-Resource_EN.pdf"}], "teaches": ["difference to the clear-sky trend (denoted CSI in the course)", "autoregressive model", "least squares", "persistence", "forecast evaluation (nRMSE, skill score, NICE)", "Extreme Learning Machine", "online learning", "frugality"]}, {"@type": "CollectionPage", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/the-thread/#page", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/the-thread/", "name": "The thread: five steps, from direct computation to trust", "description": "The thread of Cyril Voyant's research in five steps: compute when the link is known, hybridize, learn frugally, AI in its place, demonstrate trust. Each step leads to its stories.", "inLanguage": "en", "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/#website"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Person", "@id": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/#cyril-voyant", "name": "Cyril Voyant", "url": "https://person.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "about": [{"@id": "https://cyrilvoyant.github.io/approach.html#principle-2"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#persistence", "name": "Persistence", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/variability-memory-forecastability/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#elm", "name": "Extreme learning machine (ELM)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-extreme-learning-machines/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#bed", "name": "Biologically effective dose (BED)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/lql-equiv/"}], "workTranslation": {"@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/fr/le-fil/#page"}, "mentions": [{"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#gray", "name": "Gray (Gy)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url":