, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-forecast-solar-power/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#lq-model", "name": "Linear-quadratic model (LQ)", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/lql-equiv/"}, {"@type": "DefinedTerm", "@id": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/#rmse", "name": "RMSE", "inDefinedTermSet": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/ontology/", "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/evaluate-solar-forecast-persistence/"}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "The thread", "item": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/the-thread/"}]}, {"@type": "ItemList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/variability-memory-forecastability/", "name": "Which forecast for which signal?"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/atmospheric-neutrons-bnct/", "name": "Atmospheric neutrons and BNCT: quantify the limit"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/lql-equiv/", "name": "Compute, don't learn: radiobiological dose equivalence"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/tunnel-load-simulator/", "name": "Simulate what you cannot yet measure: road tunnels"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 5, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/latest-publications-and-news/why-forecast-solar-power/", "name": "How forecastable is the sun?"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 6, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/bed-eqd2-calculator-lq-lql/", "name": "Free BED and EQD2 calculator: LQ or LQL?"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 7, "url": "https://www.cyrilvoyant.com/stories/thyroid-radioiodine/", "name": "Thyroid canc